1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,900
Your AI agent changed a supplier bank account without approval.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,450
Do not ask the same agent to fix it.

3
00:00:06,460 --> 00:00:10,050
First, suspend the agent's ability to write to the vendor system.

4
00:00:10,060 --> 00:00:16,180
Next, preserve the action log, the original request, and the before-and-after record.

5
00:00:16,190 --> 00:00:23,150
Ask the finance owner to verify the bank details independently and hold affected payments.

6
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:29,150
An agent's explanation is not proof. Check the actual system records.

7
00:00:29,160 --> 00:00:35,300
This is a fictional example. Stop changes, preserve evidence,

8
00:00:35,310 --> 00:00:39,420
and let accountable people decide the recovery.

9
00:00:39,430 --> 00:00:42,340
PrismBay AI helps business leaders build practical AI systems.
